 Well, um, I just joined Twitter, um, and I love it.

00:58:40.040 --> 00:58:46.490
 Um, and so, you know, it's at the B doubt Uribe on Twitter would be one way to follow.

00:58:46.530 --> 00:58:55.970
 And I, I don't, I'm not one of those tweeters that tweets lots of stuff, you know, so don't expect too much stuff, but certainly expect the stuff that I find really important to come out on, on, on Twitter.

00:58:55.970 --> 00:59:00.530
 And then, um, I think that would probably be the best way and always email me.

00:59:00.710 --> 00:59:07.340
 Um, I love engaging with folks and talking more about these issues and seeing how to work together, um, around shared issues.

00:59:07.520 --> 00:59:09.400
 So, um, that would be another way.

00:59:09.790 --> 00:59:09.890
 Great.

00:59:09.990 --> 00:59:10.450
 Thanks, Brian.

